MultiLanguageSpellData['en'][347480] = {name = "Faeline Stomp", additional_info = "[q0]Covenant Ability\n100 yd range\nInstant\n[q]Brewmaster\nStrike the ground fiercely to expose a faeline for 30 sec, dealing (40% of Attack Power) Nature damage to up to 5 enemies, and restores (91% of Spell Power) health to up to 5 allies within 30 yds caught in the faeline. Stagger is 5% more effective for 8 sec against enemies caught in the faeline.\n\n Your abilities have a 6% chance of resetting the cooldown of Faeline Stomp while fighting on a faeline.\n\nMistweaver\nStrike the ground fiercely to expose a faeline for 30 sec, dealing (40% of Attack Power) Nature damage to up to 5 enemies, and restores (91% of Spell Power) health to up to 5 allies within 30 yds caught in the faeline. Up to 5 allies caught in the faeline are healed with an Essence Font bolt.\n\n Your abilities have a 6% chance of resetting the cooldown of Faeline Stomp while fighting on a faeline.\n\nWindwalker\nStrike the ground fiercely to expose a faeline for 30 sec, dealing (40% of Attack Power) Nature damage to up to 5 enemies, and restores (91% of Spell Power) health to up to 5 allies within 30 yds caught in the faeline. Up to 5 enemies caught in the faeline suffer an additional (65% of Attack Power) damage.\n\n Your abilities have a 6% chance of resetting the cooldown of Faeline Stomp while fighting on a faeline."}
