MultiLanguageSpellData['en'][375160] = {name = "[q3]Toxified Armor Patch", additional_info = "2 sec cast\nReagents:\nAwakened Decay (8), Adamant Scales (60), Stonecrust Hide (2)\nOptional Reagents:\nLesser Illustrious Insight (#92)\n[q]This putrid recipe requires an altar infused with powerful decay magic, rumored to be deep in Brackenhide Hollow.\nSpecialization:\nPrimordial Leatherworking - Decaying Grasp (20)\n\n[q3]Toxified Armor Patch\n61\nOptional Crafting Reagent\n[q2]+35 Recipe Difficulty\n[q2]Provides the following property: Infuses the item with the essence of decay. Also add Unique-Equipped: Embellished (2).\n[q]Usable with: Dragon Isles recipes for most unembellished Epic leather and mail."}
