MultiLanguageSpellData['en'][376531] = {name = "[q3]Explorer's Banner of Herbology", additional_info = "3.5 sec cast\nReagents:\nOmnium Draconis (12), Spool of Wilderthread (2), Vibrant Wildercloth Bolt (7)\nOptional Reagents:\nEmbroidery Thread (#181) , Illustrious Insight (#93)\nVendor:\nBoss Magor\nZone:\nThe Waking Shores\nDragonscale Expedition - Renown 15\nCost:\n750\n\nVendor:\nCataloger Jakes\nZone:\nThe Waking Shores\nDragonscale Expedition - Renown 15\nCost:\n750\n\n[q3]Explorer's Banner of Herbology\nBinds when used\n\n[q2]Use: Place a banner that increases damage done to all Air and Frost Elementals within 100 yards by 50%. Also grants 18 Deftness and Finesse to Herbalists. Lasts 10 min. Only usable in the Dragon Isles. (10 Min Cooldown)\nRequiresDragon Isles Herbalism\n(1)"}
