MultiLanguageSpellData['en'][386667] = {name = "[q3]Tinker: Polarity Amplifier", additional_info = "3.5 sec cast\nTools: Arclight Spanner , Gyromatic Micro-Adjustor\nReagents:\nAwakened Ire , Handful of Serevite Bolts (8), Greased-Up Gears (3), Arclight Capacitor , Reinforced Machine Chassis\nOptional Reagents:\nLesser Illustrious Insight (#92) , Spare Parts (#230)\n[q]Meticulously crafted tinkers of a high quality have a much greater chance of succeeding.\nVendor:\nEraneth\nZone:\nValdrakken\nCost:\n3\n\n[q3]Tinker: Polarity Amplifier\nTinker Module\nUnique-Equipped: Polarity Amplifier (1)\nGrants a magnetic charge that changes periodically. \nAim a magnet toward an enemy player. If your polarities are opposite , you both will be rooted for 6 sec. If they are identical, you both will be repelled away from each other.\n\n Your target must also have a magnetic charge.\n58\n[q]\"Tinker quality and engineering specialization impact success chance. This warranty only applies to Dragon Isles equipment.\""}
