MultiLanguageSpellData['en'][391460] = {name = "Frigid Hochenblume", additional_info = "5 yd range\n2.5 sec cast\n[q]Hochenblume is the most common herb found across the Dragon Isles. It can be found in practically any terrain, growing wherever possible.\n\n When exposed to colder climates or are located near sources of water, they can become infused with elemental frost. Gathering these types of herbs will cover the ground in slick ice, but the herbalist will be rewarded with Rousing Frost for their efforts.\n\n Herbalists specialized in Frigid herbs will gain the following effect when gathering:\n\n Frigid Petals :\nEnvelops you in a cloud of frost which causes any enemy who approaches too close to you to become frozen momentarily."}
