MultiLanguageSpellData['en'][396749] = {name = "Reckless Abandon", additional_info = "[q]Activating Recklessness generates 50 Rage and while Recklessness is active, Raging Blow and Bloodthirst are replaced by Crushing Blow and Bloodbath.\n\n Crushing Blow\nStrike a mighty blow with both weapons that deals a total of [(258.746% of Attack Power) + (258.746% of Attack Power)] Physical damage.\n\n Crushing Blow has a 25% chance to instantly reset its own cooldown and its critical strikes deal 20% additional damage.\n\nGenerates 12 Rage.\n\n Bloodbath\nAssault the target in a bloodthirsty craze, dealing (385.641% of Attack Power) Physical damage and restoring 3% of your health.\n\n Bloodbath causes the target to bleed for (60% of Attack Power) damage over 6 sec. Using Bloodbath on a target that is affected by Bloodbath extends the bleed by 6 sec.\n\nGenerates 8 Rage."}
